Try replacing:
if (user.currentAction()) {
user.useItem(user.currentAction().item());
}
user.clearActions();
with (replace ID with your skill id):
if (user.currentAction()) {
user.useItem(user.currentAction().item());
user.currentAction().setSkill(ID);
}
(If your dudes use multiple actions you need to change the skill for all, but you can try it like that)

